OL,3,GNEWSAJilly Cooper memorial bench
OL,4,Aunveiled at racecourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial bench has been unveiled in
OL,7,Fhonour of the "joy bomb" late author
OL,8,FDame Jilly Cooper at her favourite
OL,9,Fracecourse.
OL,11,FFriends and family gathered at the
OL,12,FCheltenham Racecourse event filled with
OL,13,Fchampagne and sunshine for the writer
OL,14,Fwho lived in nearby Bisley and loved
OL,15,Fhorse racing.
OL,17,FDame Jilly died on 5 October last year,
OL,18,Ffollowing a fall, aged 88. Her agent
OL,19,FFelicity Blunt said the racecourse was
OL,20,Flike her church where she loved the
OL,21,Fpeople, the jockeys, the trainers and
OL,22,Fthe fans.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
