OL,3,GNEWSAJilly Cooper memorial bench
OL,4,Aunveiled at racecourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FRacecourse CEO Guy Lavender said they
OL,7,Fhad also renamed one of the site's bars
OL,8,Fto 'The Rutshire Arms' as a nod to Dame
OL,9,FJilly's book Rivals.
